/E ( Currently, the College provides training in 8 specialties and 9 qualifications in accordance with its license for educational activities. Since 2014, the college has also offered the specialty "Nursing" with the qualification of "Applied Bachelor in Nursing." Education is conducted in both Kazakh and Russian languages. In 2022, the college successfully passed the State Attestation by the authorized body of the Ministry of Health of the Republic of Kazakhstan.)
